  data: {
    LLM: "1. Turn: On your turn, you draw one card (from the Stock or the Discard Pile) and then discard one card face-up.\n2. One-Card Limit: You must always have exactly 4 cards at the end of your turn.\n3. The Stop: Any player who has four cards of the SAME SUIT can declare 'Stop' (Selesai). The hand ends immediately.",
    Player: "1. Turn: On your turn, you draw one card (from the Stock or the Discard Pile) and then discard one card face-up.\n2. One-Card Limit: You must always have exactly 4 cards at the end of your turn.\n3. The Stop: Any player who has four cards of the SAME SUIT can declare 'Stop' (Selesai). The hand ends immediately.",
